    <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>I relax on <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="Saturday" data-hint="Choose the weekend day immediately after Friday." data-fix="I relax on Saturday." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>. &nbsp;<span class="contraction">(the day after Friday)</span></span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>The deadline is in <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="February" data-hint="Choose the month between January and March." data-fix="The deadline is in February." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>. &nbsp;<span class="contraction">(the second month, the short one)</span></span></div>
