  </div>

  <h2>Build the week and the sentence</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="monday tuesday wednesday thursday friday saturday sunday" data-hint="Start with Monday, continue through the five-day workweek, then add Saturday and Sunday." data-fix="Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday, Sunday." data-success-message="Correct. You built the Monday-first teaching sequence through the workweek and weekend.">
    <h3>Drill 3: put the seven days in order</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">Start with Monday. Build the full week, then say it.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="thursday">Thursday</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="sunday">Sunday</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="monday">Monday</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="saturday">Saturday</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="tuesday">Tuesday</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="friday">Friday</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="wednesday">Wednesday</button>
    </div>
    <div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap the days in order"></div>
    <div class="drill-actions">
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button>
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button>
    </div>
    <p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="my meeting is on monday" data-hint="Begin with My meeting, add is, then use on before the exact day." data-fix="My meeting is on Monday." data-success-message="Correct. The schedule sentence uses on because Monday is one exact day.">
    <h3>Drill 4: build the schedule sentence</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">An exact day, so use <span class="ex">on</span>. Build the sentence, then say it.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="on">on</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="meeting">meeting</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="my">My</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="monday">Monday</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="is">is</button>
    </div>
    <div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap words in order"></div>
    <div class="drill-actions">
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button>
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button>
    </div>
