  </div>

  <h2>Notice and repair errors</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="in" data-hint="Find the preposition before the exact weekday Monday." data-fix="The meeting is on Monday." data-why="Monday is an exact day, so use on, not in. We keep in for a whole month or year.">
    <h3>Drill 5: on or in?</h3>
    <p>Tap the word that is wrong.</p>
    <div class="spot-options">
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="meeting">meeting</button>
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="is">is</button>
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="in">in</button>
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="monday">Monday.</button>
    </div>
    <p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="on" data-hint="Find the preposition before the whole month March." data-fix="My birthday is in March." data-why="March is a whole month, so use in, not on. We keep on for an exact day or date like March 8th.">
    <h3>Drill 6: a day or a month?</h3>
    <p>Tap the word that is wrong.</p>
    <div class="spot-options">
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="birthday">birthday</button>
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="is">is</button>
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="on">on</button>
      <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="march">March.</button>
    </div>
    <p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="micro-drill" data-transform>
    <h3>Drill 7: say the date out loud, then reveal</h3>
    <p>Say the American date aloud first. Reveal only after you answer.</p>
    <div class="transform-list">
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item>
        <p class="transform-cue"><b>1</b> 3/8 &nbsp;→&nbsp; say the date</p>
        <button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button>
