      </div>
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item>
        <p class="transform-cue"><b>2</b> 1/1 &nbsp;→&nbsp; say the date</p>
        <button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button>
        <p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>January 1st</strong> (January first)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item>
        <p class="transform-cue"><b>3</b> 7/3 &nbsp;→&nbsp; say the date</p>
        <button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button>
        <p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>July 3rd</strong> (July third)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item>
        <p class="transform-cue"><b>4</b> 12/2 &nbsp;→&nbsp; say the date</p>
        <button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button>
        <p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>December 2nd</strong> (December second)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item>
        <p class="transform-cue"><b>5</b> 10/31 &nbsp;→&nbsp; say the date</p>
        <button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button>
        <p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>October 31st</strong> (October thirty-first)</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Read and choose</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>A class schedule message</h3>
    <p><span class="ex">“Welcome! The English class is on Tuesday, May 5. There is a small test on Friday. There is no class on June 12 because it is a holiday. See you next week!”</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You followed the Tuesday class, Friday test, and June 12 cancellation in the schedule message.">
    <h3>Read, then choose</h3>
    <div class="quiz-list">
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="on Tuesday" data-hint="The first schedule sentence gives the class weekday." data-fix="The English class is on Tuesday, May 5.">
        <p class="quiz-question">1. When is the class?</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="on Tuesday">on Tuesday</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="on Friday">on Friday</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="on Monday">on Monday</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="a test" data-hint="The second schedule sentence says what happens on Friday." data-fix="There is a small test on Friday.">
        <p class="quiz-question">2. What happens on Friday?</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="a test">a test</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="a holiday">a holiday</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="a party">a party</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="no class" data-hint="The third schedule sentence explains the June 12 holiday." data-fix="There is no class on June 12 because it is a holiday.">
        <p class="quiz-question">3. What happens on June 12?</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="no class">no class</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="a test">a test</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="a new class">a new class</button></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="drill-actions">
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-check-quiz>Check</button>
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-quiz>Reset</button>
