  <section id="next-day-retrieval" data-lesson-extension="Five-minute next-day calendar retrieval">
    <h2>Next-day retrieval</h2>
    <div class="lead-rule"></div>
    <p>Keep the main lesson closed. Retrieve the preposition, date order, ordinal, and question meaning from memory.</p>

    <div class="practice" data-choice-gap-drill data-success-message="Correct. You recalled the day/date questions, exact-date preposition, U.S. numeric order, and no-preposition next Monday form.">
      <h3>Choose the exact calendar form</h3>
      <div class="choice-bank" aria-label="Next-day calendar choices">
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="day">day</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="date">date</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="on">on</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="in">in</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="March 8th">March 8th</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="August 3rd">August 3rd</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="next Monday">next Monday</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="on next Monday">on next Monday</button>
      </div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>To ask for Tuesday, say: “What <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="day" data-hint="Tuesday is a weekday, not a numbered calendar date." data-fix="What day is it today? It's Tuesday." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> is it today?”</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>The appointment is <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="on" data-hint="March 10th is one exact calendar date." data-fix="The appointment is on March 10th." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> March 10th.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>In common U.S. numeric order, 3/8 is <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="March 8th" data-hint="The first number names the month; 3 is March." data-fix="3/8 → March 8th in common U.S. order." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>.</span></div>
