    </div>

    <div class="micro-drill" data-transform>
      <h3>Say it without choices</h3>
      <p>Say the weekday before Thursday, the month after June, and the U.S. date <span class="ex">10/31</span>. Then ask once for the weekday and once for the calendar date.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="thinking-card">
      <h3>Thirty-second production</h3>
